url: "https://github.com/ADAPredictor/Anti-Drug-Antibody-Predictor"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - immunogenicity
  - anti-drug antibody
  - MHC epitope
  - B-cell epitope
  - antibody CDR
  - germline
  - neutralizing antibody
  - protein therapeutics
  - bioinformatics
abstract: >-
  Immunogenicity — the development of anti-drug antibodies (ADA) against
  therapeutic proteins — drives reduced efficacy, altered pharmacokinetics,
  and adverse events. ADA Predictor is a web platform on the immunopred engine
  that combines MHC-I/II epitope prediction, B-cell linear epitope consensus
  scoring, antibody CDR delimitation and germline V-gene alignment, multi-signal
  risk flags with capped uplift, and an independent NAb risk score; a 289-biologic
  reference library (IDC-DS-V1) provides clinical ADA/NAb rates for background
  comparison without participating in the sequence score.
